# Cloudflare Workers static-assets redirect rules. Copied into docs/book/ after
# `mdbook build` (see the justfile `docs` recipe and .github/workflows/docs.yml)
# — it lives outside docs/src/ so mdBook does not treat it as book content.
#
# wrangler.jsonc sets "html_handling": "none" to keep mdBook's .html URLs
# canonical. The cost of that setting is that a bare "/" matches no file on
# disk, so it needs this rule: a 200 proxy (not a redirect) serving the book's
# root index.html at "/" — the docs home page, and the single most linked URL
# on the site. Retiring this line without changing html_handling 404s the root.
/    /index.html    200
